Neon Giza by Mårten Rånge (mrange)
https://github.com/mrange/synesthesia-public/tree/main/neon_giza.synScene

A Synesthesia scene, ported to Metal Shading Language for MacOS Live Wallpaper.
The original is main.glsl in that folder (last changed in commit
b770ea34ee81dbf76379355efeaa3410414a5641, 2026-01-05). Its scene.json credits it
to "mrange"; every commit to the folder is by mrange.


