No images, fonts or other assets are shipped with this scene, apart from
preview.jpg, which is a frame drawn by the shader itself.


WHAT WAS CHANGED
----------------

- The Synesthesia wrapper is gone. Its two passes are folded into one: the ray
  marcher (pass 0) and the tone mapping of pass 1 (clamp, tanh_approx, sqrt) run
  together in mainImage(). _uv, _uvc, _xy and RENDERSIZE are rebuilt from
  fragCoord and iResolution.
- Audio is replaced by slow sines: beat(), freq() and wave() no longer read the
  bass and spectrum inputs, and the bass-time term is gone from the travel time.
- The sliders are constants at their scene.json defaults. hue_offset is fixed at
  0.725 and the seven colours that script.js computed each frame are the
  author's own HSV2RGB macro with that offset.
- The scene runs at 0.3 of its original speed, so that camera travel, arc spin
  and the sines all stay in step but the picture suits a desktop background.
- Pass 1's blend with the previous frame (motion_blur) and with a user media
  layer are removed; neither exists in this app.
- Pass 1's noise filter looked at four neighbouring pixels of pass 0. Each pixel
  now looks at the two neighbours in its 2x2 pixel quad (quad_shuffle_xor).
- The KODELIFE-only code and the unused toScreenSpace() were dropped.
- Metal syntax only: thread references for out/inout parameters, `rd *= m`
  written out, any() around a vector comparison, initialised locals, PI and
  radians() defined, and a helper with smoothstep's own formula for the four
  calls whose edges are reversed.

The ray marching, the geometry, the lighting, the sky, the pyramid and every
constant of the look are the author's.


